DATA IS NOT COVERED BY THIS NOTICE

This repository contains no match data. It reads StatsBomb Open Data, which is
owned by StatsBomb / Hudl and governed exclusively by their own Public Data
User Agreement. Nothing here grants any right to that data. See DATA_SOURCE.md
before touching it, and obtain the data from its official source under its own
terms.

Committed test fixtures are synthetic, fictional data written for this project.

